{"parse": {"title": "死生对位-08", "pageid": 134869, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-07\" title=\"死生对位-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">死生对位-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">死生对位</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E6.AC.A1.E6.8C.AF.E7.BF.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一次振翅\">一次振翅</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一次振翅</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Single Flutter</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一场“暴雨”落下了。属于1987年的一切正在被冲刷殆尽。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉普拉斯科算中心里，一部分研究员停下手中的工作，注视着外面荒诞扭曲的世界；另一部分研究员则加快了步伐，趁着这难得的时机进行实验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她漠然地望了众人一眼，并未改变自己的方向。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自她加入拉普拉斯科算中心，只过了数周的时间。她在这里仍算是一个新人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但最近有些不同——她发现了一个藏在科算中心内部的秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>找到了……混沌学相关的档案。内容错漏百出，刻意得引人发笑，几乎不会引起任何人的注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>但为什么这里却藏着一个精妙的谜题？简直和这份拙劣的档案格格不入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>谁会解开这个谜题呢？尤其还是在对混沌学毫无建树的情况下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大概只有对科算中心的一切都感到无聊至极的她吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没耗费多长时间，她就绕开所有的干扰项，得到了谜底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>这是……一个坐标？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她施展了用于远程通信的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>密语声声！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最先从神秘术另一头传出的，是一阵浸润着泪水气息的香氛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>噢——很高兴有人找到了这个坐标。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这还是首次有人解开我留在科算中心的谜题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>我想那算不上有多难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>哈哈，但算上别的条件，这几乎不可能发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>比如说，它藏在一份无人关注的文档里；而这文档错漏百出，随时可能会被销毁；混沌学又与拉普拉斯的理念背道而驰——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>所以呢？女士，您究竟是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我的名字与身份并不重要，我度过了漫长的岁月，这一切于我而言已经失去意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>而我如今也并不身处拉普拉斯科算中心，不在基金会的势力范围内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我留下这个坐标，只是想邀请你加入隐藏在科算中心内部的秘密结社——洛伦兹研究所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-644701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>亲爱的，你想要找到那一只导致“暴雨”落下的，最初的蝴蝶吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“暴雨”与首次环流观测一起仓促地结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康复中心的加护病房外，一人与一磁流体正注视着里面昏睡不醒的病人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>蕾切尔……她会康复吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我不知道，黑墙研究员，我并不是专业的医生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>康复中心的报告说，蕾切尔因氧中毒导致了严重的呼吸困难与视网膜病变，现在陷入了昏迷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>她身上的监测仪器显示，在回收测控计时，她似乎在水下遇到了偶然发生的意外——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>类似于“鱼群受到莫名影响将测控计绳索咬断导致其随洋流漂浮数百米”的荒诞情况，导致回收时间延长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>具体情况，必须等她清醒后才能得知了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>她身上还有一定的时代病症状。你们该庆幸的是，观测点距离“暴雨”中心很远，因此蕾切尔没有受到时代病的过多影响，能够清醒地处理遇到的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>是啊，真是幸运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>或许这也是设计的一部分吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体没有明白对方的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>显然，这种工作，脆弱的人类还是无法胜任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>乌尔里希组长，哪怕你是意识唤醒者，我也不希望你违反条例，赶在“暴雨”落下前的最后一刻才返回安全区域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>只为了那一次的数据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体不以为然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>有些危险的工作总得有人去完成。而意识唤醒者具备这样的条件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>希望蕾切尔研究员赶紧苏醒吧！不然，理论物理组就只剩一个阿德勒了，彻头彻尾的名存实亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>好了，我要回去读洛伦兹蝴蝶最新的论文了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>她推算出一些可能发生超自然现象的坐标，并且认为其与“暴雨”的核心机制有关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>不过，这些挑衅信到底是怎么绕过科算中心的安保放在我桌上的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>超自然现象——这确实是一个不错的思路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意料之外的话语让磁流体微微侧目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>黑墙研究员，我还以为你对神秘学理论不感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……啊哈。我只是忽然明白了一些事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>她的真正目的，竟然如此简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，这一次磁流体也没有听明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你说谁？洛伦兹蝴蝶吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>不，没什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>让我回答你先前的问题，乌尔里希组长。如果我对神秘学理论完全不感兴趣，那我就不会加入科算中心了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>毕竟“暴雨”毫无疑问是一种神秘学现象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……但是我不认为科学已经完全无用，只是宇宙规则的变化太过巨大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>科学需要开始一段全新的征程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>以融合神秘学的方式？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我赞同你的观点。在拉普拉斯，大多数人认为洛伦兹研究所的作为是一种对科学的挑衅，但我持观望态度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>就像洛伦兹蝴蝶在信里所说的：</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div><i><b>唯有灵知可以理解混沌能量，唯有混沌能量的消长可以“测量”出“暴雨”。</b></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>虽然我无法真正理解她的研究方向，但这不失为一种揭开世界真相的方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>唉。洛伦兹蝴蝶，究竟是个怎样的人呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑墙望着玻璃里沉睡的同伴，略略思索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>是个无视所有规则，不会被任何事物驯化的天才吧。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "死生对位-08"}}